                            <p class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-6 text-amber-900/70">ScoreUp is free. We may earn a commission if you sign up via our links. No SSN required to read guides. We never sell your data. See <a href="/Pages/About#how-we-make-money" class="underline font-semibold">How we make money</a>.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white p-4">
                            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-300">METHODOLOGY</div>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-6 text-slate-300">We use CFPB rent reporting advisories, Experian RentBureau and TransUnion SmartMove documentation, and Equifax 2024-2026 renter credit studies. Points estimate based on TransUnion thin-file analysis (+10-20 avg) not a guarantee. US bureaus only.</p>
                        </div>
